{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51295","headline":"赠兄崇凯 · 范元凯","name":"赠兄崇凯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空（〖1〗《全唐诗》二九五作何兆诗，题爲《赠兄》。\n首句「兄」《全蜀艺文志》作「君」○《全蜀艺文志》二○）（「崇凯，内江人，奏《花萼楼赋》爲第一。\n其弟元凯，亦自负其才，故赠兄」云云。\n○今按：本诗前有李白《送友人内江范崇凯》五律一首，查各本《李白集》题下均无内江范崇凯五字，王琦亦未加注，不知杨慎有何依据。\n特记於此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范元凯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}